<title>HONG KONG: Tomei gains 100 pct of wire making unit.</title>
<headline>Tomei gains 100 pct of wire making unit.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tomei International (Holdings) Ltd said on Monday it had through a 76 percent-owned unit bought a 32 percent stake in Orient Channel International Co Ltd, making it a wholly owned subsidiary.</p>
<p>Tomei said it bought the stake from a third party Sun Lai Services Ltd for HK$3.87 million. The net asset value of the wire manufacturer and distributor was at HK$35.85 million as at June 30.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
